      "writtenOn": "2024-11-01T02:55:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When the HID function is enabled in both the RO and RW images, the UI interface appears twice when the keyboard dock is plugged in, which does not meet the criteria. Therefore, the HID function is enabled only in the RW region. For more details, refer to the following issue link.\n\nhttps://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/u/2/issues/340699222",
